{"id":"s3.3.2","slug":"repeating-decimals-ababa","title":"In the form: .ababa...","content":"<p class=\"mb-4\">A decimal with a two-digit repeating pattern, like $.ababab...$, can be converted to the fraction $\\frac{ab}{99}$, where $ab$ represents the two-digit number. This is derived from the infinite geometric series $\\frac{ab}{100} + \\frac{ab}{10000} + \\dots$, which sums to $\\frac{ab/100}{1 - 1/100} = \\frac{ab}{99}$. For example, $.242424... = \\frac{24}{99} = \\frac{8}{33}$. This pattern extends to any continuously repeating block of digits; for example, $.abcabc... = \\frac{abc}{999}$.</p>","summary":"A decimal with a two-digit repeating pattern, like , can be converted to the fraction , where represents the two-digit number.","generation_guideline":"Generate a problem converting a two-digit or three-digit repeating decimal to a fraction.","questions":[{"id":1,"text":"Convert $.272727...$ to a fraction.","answer":"3/11","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","repeating-decimals","conversions"]},{"id":2,"text":"Convert $.414141...$ to a fraction.","answer":"41/99","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","repeating-decimals","conversions"]},{"id":3,"text":"Convert $.212121...$ to a fraction.","answer":"7/33","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","repeating-decimals","conversions"]},{"id":4,"text":"Convert $.818181...$ to a fraction.","answer":"9/11","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","repeating-decimals","conversions"]},{"id":5,"text":"Convert $.363636...$ to a fraction.","answer":"4/11","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","repeating-decimals","conversions"]},{"id":6,"text":"Convert $.020202...$ to a fraction.","answer":"2/99","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","repeating-decimals","conversions"]},{"id":7,"text":"Convert $.727272...$ to a fraction.","answer":"8/11","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","repeating-decimals","conversions"]},{"id":8,"text":"Convert $.151515...$ to a fraction.","answer":"5/33","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","repeating-decimals","conversions"]},{"id":9,"text":"Convert $.308308...$ to a fraction.","answer":"308/999","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","repeating-decimals","conversions"]},{"id":10,"text":"Convert $.231231...$ to a fraction.","answer":"77/333","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","repeating-decimals","conversions"]},{"id":11,"text":"Convert $.303303...$ to a fraction.","answer":"101/333","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","repeating-decimals","conversions"]},{"id":12,"text":"Convert $.099099099...$ to a fraction.","answer":"11/111","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","repeating-decimals","conversions"]}]}